| Balanced BST (AVL, Red-Black, TreeMap) | O(log n) | O(log n) | O(1) | O(log n) | O(log n) | O(log n) | O(1) | O(log n) | O(n) | Sorted iteration O(n); floor / ceiling / range O(log n) |
