| Trie | O(L) | O(L) | O(1) | O(L) | O(1) | O(L) | O(1) | O(L) | O(N * L) | L = key length, independent of n; best case = first char missing |
| B-Tree / B+ Tree | O(log n) | O(log n) | O(1) | O(log n) | O(log n) | O(log n) | O(1) | O(log n) | O(n) | O(log_B n) disk reads; fast range scans (B+) |
